# System units on rigel: `enable <unit>` (enabled and started) or `mask <unit>`.
# Applied by `nomarchy install host`, after this host's copies, so a unit file shipped as a
# copy exists before it is enabled.
#
# Once per boot: turns hibernation off when booted into a kernel a resume would not boot
# (the LTS entry). See hosts/rigel/hibernate-guard/.
enable hibernate-guard.service
